       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>This is the first column of the doc
     <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>ument. In this document we take ad
     <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>vantage only of the simplest features of the rotpages.sty package, i.e. we only use the basic 
     <Code xmlns="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn"
       >
      <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>\rotboxpages
     </Code>
     <?MarkedContent page="1" ?> and 
     <Code xmlns="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn"
       >
      <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>\endrotboxpages
     </Code>
     <?MarkedContent page="1" ?> commands.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>The first columns are typeset nor
     <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>mally. To fill them a little, we include the first part of 
     <Em xmlns="http://iso.org/pdf2/ssn"
       >
      <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>Pinocchio
     </Em>
     <?MarkedContent page="1" ?> by Carlo Col
     <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>lodi.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>CHAPTER 1
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <Em xmlns="http://iso.org/pdf2/ssn"
       >
      <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>How it happened that Mastro Cherry, carpenter, found a piece of wood that wept and laughed like a child
     </Em>
     <?MarkedContent page="1" ?> 
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>Centuries ago there lived —
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>”A king!” my little readers will say im
     <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>mediately.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>No, children, you are mistaken. Once upon a time there was a piece of wood. It was not an expensive piece of wood. Far from it. Just a common block of firewood, one of those thick, solid logs that are put on the fire in winter to make cold rooms cozy and warm.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>I do not know how this really hap
     <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>pened, yet the fact remains that one fine day this piece of wood found itself in the shop of an old carpenter. His real 
     <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>name was Mastro Antonio, but everyone called him Mastro Cherry, for the tip of his nose was so round and red and shiny that it looked like a ripe cherry.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>As soon as he saw that piece of wood, Mastro Cherry was filled with joy. Rubbing his hands together happily, he mumbled half to himself:
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>”This has come in the nick of time. I shall use it to make the leg of a table.”
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>He grasped the hatchet quickly to peel off the bark and shape the wood. But as he was about to give it the first blow, he stood still with arm uplifted, for he had heard a wee, little voice say in a beseeching tone: ”Please be careful! Do not hit me so hard!”
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>What a look of surprise shone on Mas
     <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>tro Cherry’s face! His funny face became still funnier.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>He turned frightened eyes about the room to find out where that wee, lit
     <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>tle voice had come from and he saw no one! He looked under the bench–no one! He peeped inside the closet–no one! He searched among the shavings– no one! He opened the door to look up and down the street–and still no one!
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>”Oh, I see!” he then said, laughing 
     <?MarkedContent page="2" ?>and scratching his Wig. ”It can easily be seen that I only thought I heard the tiny voice say the words! Well, well–to work once more.”
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="2" ?>He struck a most solemn blow upon the piece of wood.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="2" ?>”Oh, oh! You hurt!” cried the same far-away little voice.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="2" ?>Mastro Cherry grew dumb, his eyes popped out of his head, his mouth opened wide, and his tongue hung down on his chin.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="2" ?>As soon as he regained the use of his senses, he said, trembling and stuttering from fright:
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="2" ?>”Where did that voice come from, when there is no one around? Might it be that this piece of wood has learned to weep and cry like a child? I can hardly believe it. Here it is–a piece of common firewood, good only to burn in the stove, the same as any other. Yet– might some
     <?MarkedContent page="2" ?>one be hidden in it? If so, the worse for him. I’ll fix him!”
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="2" ?>With these words, he grabbed the log with both hands and started to knock it about unmercifully. He threw it to the floor, against the walls of the room, and even up to the ceiling.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="2" ?>He listened for the tiny voice to moan and cry. He waited two minutes–nothing; five minutes–nothing; ten minutes–nothing.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="2" ?>”Oh, I see,” he said, trying bravely to laugh and ruffling up his wig with his hand. ”It can easily be seen I only imag
     <?MarkedContent page="2" ?>ined I heard the tiny voice! Well, well–to work once more!”
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="2" ?>The poor fellow was scared half to death, so he tried to sing a gay song in 
     <?MarkedContent page="2" ?>order to gain courage.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="2" ?>He set aside the hatchet and picked up the plane to make the wood smooth and even, but as he drew it to and fro, he heard the same tiny voice. This time it giggled as it spoke:
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="2" ?>”Stop it! Oh, stop it! Ha, ha, ha! You tickle my stomach.”
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="2" ?>This time poor Mastro Cherry fell as if shot. When he opened his eyes, he found himself sitting on the floor.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="2" ?>His face had changed; fright had turned even the tip of his nose from red to deepest purple.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="2" ?>Note that the next columns are upside down.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="5" ?>Here come the rotated columns. Note that while formatting the document, this column is 
     <Em xmlns="http://iso.org/pdf2/ssn"
       >
      <?MarkedContent page="5" ?>de
      <?MarkedContent page="5" ?>ferred
     </Em>
     <?MarkedContent page="5" ?>, until all the block of ro
     <?MarkedContent page="5" ?>tated columns is processed. In this way, this column is printed as the last one of the block. How
     <?MarkedContent page="5" ?>ever, if the printed work is read upside down, this column cor
     <?MarkedContent page="5" ?>rectly appears as the first of the block.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="5" ?>Obviously, also this column contains the continuation of the novel:
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="5" ?>CHAPTER 2
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <Em xmlns="http://iso.org/pdf2/ssn"
       >
      <?MarkedContent page="5" ?>Mastro Cherry gives the piece of wood to his friend Geppetto, who takes it to make himself a Marionette that will dance, fence, and turn somersaults
     </Em>
     <?MarkedContent page="5" ?> 
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="5" ?>In that very instant, a loud knock sounded on the door. ”Come in,” said the carpenter, not having an atom of strength left with which to stand up.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="5" ?>At the words, the door opened and a dapper little old man came in. His name was Geppetto, but to the boys of the neighborhood he was Polendina
     <footnotemark xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
        rolemaps-to="Lbl"
        referenced-as="2"
       >
       <?References objects="1" ?>
      <text-fragment xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
         xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
         Layout:TextPosition="Sup"
         rolemaps-to="Span"
        >
       <?MarkedContent page="5" ?>1
      </text-fragment>
     </footnotemark>
     <footnote xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
        rolemaps-to="FENote"
        referenced-as="1"
       >
       <?References objects="2" ?>
      <footnotelabel xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
         rolemaps-to="Lbl"
        >
       <text-fragment xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
          xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
          Layout:TextPosition="Sup"
          rolemaps-to="Span"
         >
        <?MarkedContent page="5" ?>1
       </text-fragment>
      </footnotelabel>
      <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
         rolemaps-to="Part"
        >
       <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
          xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
          Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
          rolemaps-to="P"
         >
        <?MarkedContent page="5" ?>Corneal mush
       </text-block>
      </semantic-para>
     </footnote>
     <?MarkedContent page="5" ?>, on account of the wig he always wore which was just the color of yellow corn.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>is rotated, while the page head
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>ers and footers, comprising the page number, are printed with the standard orientation. Take also a quick look at the footnote and ob
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>serve that it is in the right place.
     <?MarkedContent page="5" ?>Here we make a small break in the story. Please, take a second to observe how the column content 
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>Note also that in order to intro
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>duce a frame, the rotated columns are slightly smaller (i.e. they con
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>tain a little less text than the nor
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>mal ones.)
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>After this informative bit, it is time for some more Pinocchio:
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>Geppetto had a very bad tem
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>per. Woe to the one who called him Polendina! He became as wild as a beast and no one could soothe him.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>”Good day, Mastro Antonio,” said Geppetto. ”What are you do
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>ing on the floor?”
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>”I am teaching the ants their A B C’s.”
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>”Good luck to you!”
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>”What brought you here, friend Geppetto?”
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>”My legs. And it may flat
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>ter you to know, Mastro Antonio, that I have come to you to beg for a favor.”
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>”Here I am, at your service,” answered the carpenter, raising himself on to his knees.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>”This morning a fine idea came to me.”
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>”Let’s hear it.”
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>must be wonderful, one that will be able to dance, fence, and turn somersaults. With it I intend to go around the world, to earn my crust of bread and cup of wine. What do you think of it?”
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>”I thought of making myself a beautiful wooden Marionette. It 
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>”Bravo, Polendina!” cried the same tiny voice which came from no one knew where.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>On hearing himself called Polendina, Mastro Geppetto turned the color of a red pepper and, facing the carpenter, said to him angrily:
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>”Why do you insult me?”
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>”Who is insulting you?”
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>”You called me Polendina.”
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>”I did not.”
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>”I suppose you think _I_ did! Yet I KNOW it was you.”
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>”No!”
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>”Yes!”
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>”No!”
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>”Yes!”
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>And growing angrier each mo
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>ment, they went from words to blows, and finally began to scratch and bite and slap each other.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>When the fight was over, Mas
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>tro Antonio had Geppetto’s yel
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>low wig in his hands and Geppetto found the carpenter’s curly wig in his mouth.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>”Give me back my wig!” shouted Mastro Antonio in a surly voice.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="3" ?>friends.”
     <?MarkedContent page="4" ?>”You return mine and we’ll be 
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="3" ?>The two little old men, each with his own wig back on his own head, shook hands and swore to be good friends for the rest of their lives.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="3" ?>”Well then, Mastro Geppetto,” said the carpenter, to show he bore him no ill will, ”what is it you want?”
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="3" ?>”I want a piece of wood to make a Marionette. Will you give it to me?”
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="3" ?>Mastro Antonio, very glad in
     <?MarkedContent page="3" ?>deed, went immediately to his bench to get the piece of wood which had frightened him so much. But as he was about to give it to his friend, with a violent jerk it slipped out of his hands and hit against poor Geppetto’s thin legs.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="3" ?>”Ah! Is this the gentle way, Mastro Antonio, in which you make your gifts? You have made me almost lame!”
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="3" ?>”I swear to you I did not do it!”
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="3" ?>”It was _I_, of course!”
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="3" ?>”It’s the fault of this piece of wood.”
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="3" ?>”You’re right; but remember you were the one to throw it at my legs.”
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="3" ?>”I did not throw it!”
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="3" ?>”Liar!”
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="3" ?>”Geppetto, do not insult me or I shall call you Polendina.”
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="3" ?>”Idiot.”
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="3" ?>”Polendina!”
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="3" ?>”Donkey!”
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="3" ?>”Polendina!”
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="3" ?>”Ugly monkey!”
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="3" ?>”Polendina!”
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="3" ?>On hearing himself called Polendina for the third time, Geppetto lost his head with rage and threw himself upon the carpenter. Then and there they gave each other a sound thrashing.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="3" ?>After this fight, Mastro Anto
     <?MarkedContent page="3" ?>nio had two more scratches on his nose, and Geppetto had two buttons missing from his coat. Thus having settled their ac
     <?MarkedContent page="3" ?>counts, they shook hands and swore to be good friends for the rest of their lives.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
     <?MarkedContent page="3" ?>Then Geppetto took the fine piece of wood, thanked Mastro Antonio, and limped away toward home.
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
      rolemaps-to="Part"
     >
    <text-block xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
       xmlns:Layout="http://iso.org/pdf/ssn/Layout"
       Layout:TextAlign="Justify"
       rolemaps-to="P"
      >
    </text-block>
   </semantic-para>
   <semantic-para xmlns="https://www.latex-project.org/ns/dflt"
